  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale up finding of TB missing cases - Cameroon (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cameroon, Tuberculosis, Ministry of Public Health of the Republic of Cameroon (MOH)This program has the following goals: Contribuer &#xe0; la fin de l&apos;&#xe9;pid&#xe9;mie globale de la TB en facilitant l&apos;acc&#xe8;s au diagnostic et &#xe0; la prise en charge de toutes les formes de TB et en promouvant la pr&#xe9;vention de la maladie/  Contribute to ending the global TB epidemic by facilitating access to diagnossis and care for all fors of TB and by promoting disease prevention. The objectives of this program are: R&#xe9;duire de 30% le taux de mortalit&#xe9; d&#xfb; &#xe0; la TB par rapport &#xe0; 2021/  Reduce the mortality rate due to TB by 30% compared to 2021.  R&#xe9;duire de 30% le taux d&apos;incidence de la TB par rapport &#xe0; 2021/  Reduce the incidence rate of TB by 30% compared to 2021.  R&#xe9;duire &#xe0; moins de 10% la proportion des familles qui supportent des co&#xfb;ts catastrophiques d&#xfb;s &#xe0; la TB/  Reduce less than 10% the proportion of families who bear catastrophic costs due to TB</narrative>
  </description>
